  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41159722",
      "title": "Adding A Loading Page",
      "lectureOrder": 109,
      "videoOrder": 102,
      "sourceHash": "ba1f9f5e2aa558d435d2f066500fbabe178c98702c684e21187b6939947a23dd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So now that we're able to load those meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "there's one thing you might notice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "When we reload this slash meals page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "it takes a couple of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.47,
          "en": "until we see something on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "and that hopefully makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 19.23,
          "en": "because we added this delay here in that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.23,
          "end": 22.32,
          "en": "where we fetch the meals from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.32,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "So we added a two second delay here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 27.42,
          "en": "and that's why we have this two second pause",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.42,
          "end": 29.013,
          "en": "before the page updates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "Obviously, if we would make this longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "let's say five seconds, we'd have to wait for five seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 38.613,
          "en": "before we see anything on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "However, you then might notice that if you then go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "to another page and you come back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "the meals page is there instantly, pretty much,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 51.723,
          "en": "we don't have to wait those five seconds then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.31,
          "end": 54.36,
          "en": "and that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 59.36,
          "en": "because NextJS performs some pretty aggressive caching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 60.243,
          "en": "under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.68,
          "end": 66.15,
          "en": "To be precise, it caches any page you visited,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.15,
          "end": 68.61,
          "en": "including the data of that page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.61,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "and if you then go to another page and come back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "it loads that existing page from the cache,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 78.84,
          "en": "so that it can show it to you as quickly as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "And only if you reload this page, if you leave the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 84,
          "en": "and you come back, essentially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84,
          "end": 86.883,
          "en": "only then is the page being recreated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "Now that's of course great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "but it would be nice if we had some loading indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "whilst this page is loading when we visit it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 101.03999999999999,
          "en": "because at the moment, we have to wait for five seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.03999999999999,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "and we don't see anything during these five seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 106.77000000000001,
          "en": "If I'm on the starting page, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.77000000000001,
          "end": 110.7,
          "en": "and I reload that page and I then go to Browse Meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.7,
          "end": 112.5,
          "en": "and it's therefore not in the cache,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.5,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "I'm sitting there and I'm not sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "if my navigation request worked or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "because only after five seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "am I redirected to that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 124.743,
          "en": "And that's not a great user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.73,
          "end": 127.98,
          "en": "This experience can be improved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.98,
          "end": 131.46,
          "en": "by adding another special file to our folder though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.46,
          "end": 134.52,
          "en": "You can go to that page, which is loading data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.52,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "which might take a bit longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 141.3,
          "en": "and next to it you can add a loading.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.3,
          "end": 146.3,
          "en": "which just like layout and page is a reserved file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 151.2,
          "en": "And this file will become active if the page next to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 155.94,
          "en": "or any nested page or layout is loading data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.94,
          "end": 158.79,
          "en": "And in that case, that loading.js content is shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 161.433,
          "en": "as a fallback until the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "So here we can then therefore export a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 167.97,
          "en": "in that loading.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 172.97,
          "en": "and name it MealsLoadingPage or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 178.35,
          "en": "And then in there, I want to return a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.35,
          "end": 181.363,
          "en": "where I say Fetching meals...,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 185.64,
          "en": "and I also wanna have some styling for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.64,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "and therefore I prepared a loading.module.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "which you find attached, which sets up some basic styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 195.873,
          "en": "for this loading.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.01,
          "end": 202.01,
          "en": "In order to use it, we then just have to import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.26,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "from loading.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 208.84,
          "en": "and then add a class of the name loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 213.933,
          "en": "like this to this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "Well, and with that, if you save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "and you then reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "you see this Fetching meals text until the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 226.41,
          "en": "And if we were to go to the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.41,
          "end": 228.3,
          "en": "and we then navigate to browse meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.3,
          "end": 230.28,
          "en": "we also see this immediately now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.28,
          "end": 232.59,
          "en": "hence knowing that our navigation worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.59,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "and what's going on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 236.82,
          "en": "And that's now of course, a better user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 238.02,
          "en": "than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
